  after: [
    "let gives a value a name. present contains Just \"Ada\" and missing contains Nothing. The : Maybe<String> annotation checks the type; it does not convert the string or validate its contents.",
    "match selects the line for the value’s alternative. In Just name, name contains the string; Nothing has no value to extract. Both lines return a string, giving the caller a display for either case.",
    "An empty string is also present inside Just. The final call prints Nickname: [], distinct from the missing Nothing case.",
    "pub effect fn main is the program entry. do runs the println steps from top to bottom to display strings. Function calls separate arguments with spaces."
